  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      270.89,
      400.96,
      295.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      311.09,
      400.92,
      349.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Births and deathsRegistration (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013 and shall bedeemed to have come into operation from January 1, 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.73,
      400.94,
      483.23
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 24 of the Births and Deaths registration Act,(Chapter 110) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (2) of thatsection, by the substitution for all the words from \u201ceverysuch declaration shall\u201d to the words \u201cthe stamps shall besupplied by the declarant\u201d of the words \u201cevery suchdeclaration shall be accompanied by a fee of rupees fifty orsuch other amount as may be prescribed by the Minister,which shall be paid by the declarant.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      498.65,
      400.93,
      590.39
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 27 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (2) of that section by the substitutionin paragraph (b) from the words \u201cand bearing a stamp,\u201d to thewords \u201ctwo years have so elapsed.\u201d of the words \u201ctogetherwith a fee of rupees fifty or such other amount as may beprescribed by the Minister, which shall be paid by theapplicant.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      605.93,
      400.92,
      670.79
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 27A of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (2) of that section by the substitutionfor the words \u201cshall bear a stamp of the value of five rupeessupplied\u201d of the words \u201c together with a fee of rupees fifty tobe paid\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
